    "id": "pharmacology-emt-046",
    "moduleSlug": "pharmacology-emt",
    "text": "Epinephrine for anaphylaxis is dosed at 0.01 mg/kg in children. A child weighs 20 kg. What is the correct dose and device?",
    "questionStyle": "standard",
