        "explanation": "Incorrect. The adult EpiPen threshold is typically >30 kg. At 20 kg, the EpiPen Jr is appropriate. Giving the adult dose (0.3 mg) is a relative overdose — safe in life-threatening anaphylaxis but not standard dosing."
