        "text": "Laryngospasm — suction the airway and attempt repositioning",
        "isCorrect": false,
        "order": 2,
        "explanation": "Incorrect. Laryngospasm occurs with airway stimulus in conscious/semiconscious patients and causes bilateral airway obstruction. It does not explain unilateral absent sounds and tracheal deviation."
