    "explanation": "The standard prehospital IN dose is 2 mg total, administered as 1 mg into each nostril. The NAEMSP 2023 position statement and NEMSES 2021 Ch.11 specify this split-dose technique to maximise mucosal absorption surface area. Onset by the IN route is 2–5 minutes.",
