        "isCorrect": true,
        "order": 1,
        "explanation": "Correct. Anticholinergic and cholinergic toxidromes are physiological opposites. Brady Ch.30 contrasts them using 'dry-hot-mad-red' vs SLUDGE/DUMBELS."
