    "explanation": "Correct sequence: (1) PPE for EMT; (2) Remove and bag contaminated clothing immediately — stops ongoing absorption; (3) Copious water skin irrigation; (4) Airway management — suction secretions, O2, BVM if needed; (5) Position to protect from aspiration; (6) Rapid transport with ALS intercept for atropine (antidote for muscarinic effects) and pralidoxime. Skipping decontamination contaminates the ambulance and the rescuer.",
