        "id": "toxicology-poisoning-047-0",
        "text": "PPE → remove contaminated clothing → skin irrigation → airway management → rapid transport with ALS intercept",
        "isCorrect": true,
        "order": 1,
        "explanation": "Correct. This sequence prevents ongoing absorption and rescuer contamination before airway management. Brady Ch.30 and NEMSES 2021 Ch.11 both specify decontamination before patient contact and transport."
