        "text": "Opioids — respiratory depression causes CO2 retention and MUDPILES-type acidosis",
        "isCorrect": false,
        "order": 3,
        "explanation": "Incorrect. Opioid-induced respiratory depression causes respiratory acidosis (elevated CO2), not anion gap metabolic acidosis. MUDPILES describes metabolic, not respiratory, acidosis causes."
