    "id": "toxicology-poisoning-049",
    "moduleSlug": "toxicology-poisoning",
    "text": "A scene safety principle in HazMat incidents states that rescuers should be upwind, uphill, and upstream. Why does this three-axis rule protect against chemical exposure?",
    "questionStyle": "standard",
