    "explanation": "In an infant or child with suspected cervical spine injury, the jaw-thrust manoeuvre is preferred over the head-tilt chin-lift because it opens the airway without extending the neck. Cervical spine movement is minimised, reducing the risk of worsening an unstable injury.",
