    "explanation": "NEMSIS stands for National EMS Information System. It establishes a standardised minimum data set for PCR (Patient Care Report) data collection, enabling national EMS data analysis, quality improvement, and research. NEMSIS-compliant PCRs must include patient demographics, chief complaint, mechanism of illness/injury, SAMPLE history, primary and secondary assessment findings, vital signs with times, treatments with times, and transport destination.",
