    "caseOutcome": "",
    "sourceRef": "FEMA ICS-100 Course Material — Incident Action Plan",
    "explanation": "The Incident Action Plan (IAP) is the operational planning document for each operational period of an incident. It specifies the incident objectives, tactics, resource assignments, communication plans, medical plan for responders, and safety message. For small incidents the IAP may be verbal; for large or complex incidents it must be written. The IAP is developed by the Planning Section and approved by the Incident Commander.",
